# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings on every system, so the code-tree digest is the same
# on Windows, a Mac and the node, and the bash scripts run on the node. A Windows checkout that turned LF into CRLF
# broke both once; START_HERE.md also sets core.autocrlf false before the first checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.parquet binary
*.xlsx binary
*.h5 binary
*.h5ad binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.wav binary
